                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ukuboko kw’Uhoraho gushikamira Abanyashidodi n’abāhakūkira, arabageseza, abatērēra ibihute. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyashidodi babonye bibaye birtyo baravugana, bat’ Isandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli ntikagume muri twebge, kuk’ ukuboko kwayo kudushikamiye, twe na Dagoni imana yacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.13.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 13:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kwo gutuma ku baganwa b’Abafilisitiya bose, bakoraniraho barababaza, bati Mbeg’ isandugu y’Imana y’ Abisirayeli tuyigenze dute? Barabishura, bati Ni bayijane i Gati. Nuko bajanay’ iyo sandugu y’ Imana y’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 2:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 6:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamaze kuyishikanayo, ukuboko kw’Uhoraho kurwanya ico gisagara, kubaca ivutu; atērēra ibihute abo mur’ ico gisagara, abato n’abakuru, bisēsa ku mibiri yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw iyo sandugu y’Imana bayirungika i Ekuroni. Igiserukayo, Abanyekuroni bavuza induru, bati Batuzaniye ya sandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli ngw itumarane n’ abacu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kwo gutuma ku baganwa bose b’Abafilisitiya, bakoraniraho, barababgira, bati Ni murungike iyi sandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli, isubire aho yahora, ireke kutumarana n’abacu; kuko mur’ ico gisagara cose urupfu rwari rwabaciye ivutu, kand’ ukuboko kw’Imana kwari kubashikamiye cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
